    "name": "NexoraX E-Commerce API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for NexoraX E-Commerce Backend\n\n**Features:**\n- Authentication (Register, Login, Get Profile)\n- Products Management (CRUD operations)\n- Shopping Cart Management\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Set your BASE_URL in environment variables (default: http://localhost:5000)\n2. Register/Login to get AUTH_TOKEN (automatically saved)\n3. Admin users can manage products\n4. All users can manage their cart",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "40773299"
  },
